 torch.manual_seed(seed)","key":"NmbUMFeh97"},{"type":"outputs","id":"_k9iIZeJn7UlQAIixGrin","children":[],"key":"AN1IFyDgPt"}],"key":"URyz6VPaS2"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. Random NumPy Array","key":"Zlq26CqGIe"}],"key":"CMKJw3WfrX"}],"identifier":"id-3-random-numpy-array","label":"3. Random NumPy Array","html_id":"id-3-random-numpy-array","implicit":true,"key":"C9nz4z5Ax7"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"np.random.randint(low, high, size)","key":"m2aLR44s4z"},{"type":"text","value":" draws from ","key":"JjTMQIeqnL"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"low","key":"QUQEnRk3wG"},{"type":"text","value":" (inclusive) up to ","key":"wcS0ar1WVy"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"high","key":"JIolaBNRpT"},{"type":"text","value":" (exclusive), which matches the \"0 (inclusive) and 5 (exclusive)\" wording of the instructions. The dtype is set to ","key":"pkxE3QW9Lz"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"int32","key":"rTqBgwjSHH"},{"type":"text","value":" on purpose here — step 5 asks to change the tensor's dtype from ","key":"wqWmwdy0fw"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"int32","key":"mdNsTHaKa5"},{"type":"text","value":" to ","key":"F1Gd0R4mCI"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"int64","key":"J0GCIzJnz7"},{"type":"text","value":" later, and that only makes sense to demonstrate if the array (and the tensor made from it) is actually ","key":"I4TXP7I9yE"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"int32","key":"jlInnefoA7"},{"type":"text","value":" to begin with.","key":"dry1W8nMpb"}],"key":"heQ1SQ44h0"}],"key":"EYAeBNSls1"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-09-21T13:51:23.205492Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-09-21T13:51:23.205271Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-09-21T13:51:23.220116Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-09-21T13:51:23.218634Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"set_